"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#indeterminate","content":"Use indeterminate progress while preparing an upload whose total size is unknown.\nOnce the total is known, set `isIndeterminate` to false and supply a measured value."},"953":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-15","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#aria-support","content":"`role=\"progressbar\"` on the container"},"954":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-16","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#aria-support","content":"`aria-valuenow` is omitted while indeterminate; otherwise it reflects the current value"},"955":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-17","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#aria-support","content":"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"},"956":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-18","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#aria-support","content":"`aria-valuetext` and visible value text are omitted while indeterminate; otherwise `aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`)"},"957":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-bar-19","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-bar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-bar#aria-support","content":"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"},"958":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","type":"page","content":"ProgressSteps","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/progress-steps"},"959":{"id":"/docs/components/progress-steps-0","page_id":"/docs/components/progress-steps","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/progress-steps","content":"A multi-step progress indicator for wizard and onboarding